I hate it.

270
00:16:39.298 --> 00:16:41.579
Then what are we doing here?
Let's go. Let's go.

271
00:16:41.662 --> 00:16:43.043
-Let's just get out of here.
-I-I can't.

272
00:16:43.126 --> 00:16:45.492
I can't when there are
people looking to me

273
00:16:45.628 --> 00:16:47.329
